//! Compile-time probe that forces semantic analysis of every public function
//! in the library. Zig lazily compiles function bodies, so an uncalled public
//! function can harbor a compile error undetected. Taking the address of each
//! public function (without calling it) forces its body to be checked.
//!
//! This file is compiled by `zig build compile-all` and in CI, so dead-code
//! regressions are caught before they ship.

